# core.autocrlf is true in this clone. Git's own binary detection has protected the published
# PDF so far, but detection is a heuristic and a corrupted published report would be permanent
# in a public repo. These lines make it a rule instead of a guess.

*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.zip  binary

# The Strategy Tester writes UTF-16 HTML. Never touch the line endings or git will mangle it.
*.htm  -text
*.html -text
